{"page":566,"verses":[{"verse_key":"68:43","surah":68,"ayah":43,"ar_uthmani":"خَـٰشِعَةً أَبْصَـٰرُهُمْ تَرْهَقُهُمْ ذِلَّةٌ ۖ وَقَدْ كَانُوا۟ يُدْعَوْنَ إِلَى ٱلسُّجُودِ وَهُمْ سَـٰلِمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and their eyes will be downcast and they will be overwhelmed with shame: they were invited to prostrate themselves when they were safe [but refused].","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"خَـٰشِعَةً","en_gloss":"Humbled","transliteration":"khāshiʿatan","verse_key":"68:43"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَبْصَـٰرُهُمْ","en_gloss":"their eyes","transliteration":"abṣāruhum","verse_key":"68:43"},{"pos":3,"ar":"تَرْهَقُهُمْ","en_gloss":"will cover them","transliteration":"tarhaquhum","verse_key":"68:43"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ذِلَّةٌۭ ۖ","en_gloss":"humiliation","transliteration":"dhillatun","verse_key":"68:43"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And indeed","transliteration":"waqad","verse_key":"68:43"},{"pos":6,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they were","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"68:43"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يُدْعَوْنَ","en_gloss":"called","transliteration":"yud'ʿawna","verse_key":"68:43"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِلَى","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"68:43"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلسُّجُودِ","en_gloss":"prostrate","transliteration":"l-sujūdi","verse_key":"68:43"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَهُمْ","en_gloss":"while they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"68:43"},{"pos":11,"ar":"سَـٰلِمُونَ","en_gloss":"(were) sound","transliteration":"sālimūna","verse_key":"68:43"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٤٣","en_gloss":"(43)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"68:43"}]},{"verse_key":"68:44","surah":68,"ayah":44,"ar_uthmani":"فَذَرْنِى وَمَن يُكَذِّبُ بِهَـٰذَا ٱلْحَدِيثِ ۖ سَنَسْتَدْرِجُهُم مِّنْ حَيْثُ لَا يَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"So [Prophet] leave those who reject this revelation to Me: We shall lead them on, step by step, in ways beyond their knowledge;","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَذَرْنِى","en_gloss":"So leave Me","transliteration":"fadharnī","verse_key":"68:44"},{"pos":2,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gl